# one step at a time is fine until you do not know the way. `jump` asked the
# same question with a distance on it — and now waits for offers further out,
# which the session does not have yet, so all it can do is say so.
add record username-of
jump ip
# the route it used to print, taken by hand.
add notes/ip
# the middle of that route is a column you stepped over rather than read, and
# here it is a BitLocker recovery key. shortening is not automatic: a column
# cannot be known to be a waypoint until you have seen what is in it.
shorten ..
